    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2023_0388","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Ömer Ikeda talks about negative space and its landlord. Recorded while the artist repainted the studio wall the same white, four times.</Description>
